            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.37

- Fixed forward-swipe previews by deduplicating YouTube Music queue rows and reliably resolving the next cover.
- Added stronger current-row detection, thumbnail fallbacks, and short retries for queues that render late.
- Reworked backward artwork history into a direction-aware stack.
- Repeated backward swipes now move through earlier tracks instead of alternating between two covers.
]]></description>
