            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.36

- Kept interactive artwork movement directly synchronized with the trackpad until release.
- Removed the mid-gesture acceleration when swiping toward the previous track.
- Prefetched the next queued cover so forward swipes no longer reveal an empty tile.
- Added a smooth late-artwork fallback and hardened the transition handoff after a committed swipe.
]]></description>
