            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.35

- Added interactive artwork scrubbing for two-finger trackpad gestures.
- A partial swipe now reveals the adjacent track cover and springs back when released.
- A deliberate drag or quick flick commits the next or previous track with a fluid transition.
- Added queue-aware adjacent artwork loading and Reduce Motion support.
]]></description>
